Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind howling]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.09,0:00:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.45,0:01:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NHow long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[AHN SANGMIN]\NAbout three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would mean three days\Nhave passed on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And red gates are supposed\Nto be especially brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[yawns]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Welp, it's fair to assume\Nthis punk's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a huge waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[HWANG DONGSOO]\NOh, and just to be clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo Sung isn't with\Nthe White Tiger Guild, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I gotta wonder\Nwhat business he has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,with your strike team\Nif he's unaffiliated with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung\Nis an acquaintance of mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,he wanted to observe\Na C-Rank raid,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so I brought him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[Hwang Dongsoo scoffs]\NIs that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[footfall]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[HWANG DONGSOO]\NDo I really seem that gullible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what have you\Ndug up this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.09,0:02:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always had\Na knack for sniffing out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,hunters of interest,\Nso what makes an E-Rank--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NDongsoo Hwang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your filthy hands\Noff of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,D'you think that you\Ncan order me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[HWANG DONGSOO]\NYou're just a big fish
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,in a tiny pond of a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NSay that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[trembling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If they aren't stopped soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have an S-Rank battle\Non our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[HWANG DONGSOO]\NYou wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[trembling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[thud]\N[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kim Chul shivering]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was way too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we didn't have\Nthe right gear with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's... that's why we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering\Nwhere all the bears went!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did those E-Ranks do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, those weaklings\Ncould never!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[trembling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot, the Slayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:03:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be less impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,if you hadn't held back\Nat the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms surely\Nwould've been blown off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[Woo Jinchul sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO JINCHUL] While I don't\Nknow what his significance
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,is to you, Hunter Hwang,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I will at least say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to re-evaluate\NHunter Sung two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He was an E-Rank then,\Nand he's an E-Rank now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Surveillance Team declared\Nyour brother's cause of death
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,as KIA while fighting\Na magic beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, perfect way\Nto silence public inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[HWANG DONGSOO]\NAnd laughably fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The real killer's gotta be\Nthat rich little turd
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,from Yoojin Construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you believe,\NI'm confused
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,as to why you're after Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna spill some blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:04:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've got a great excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[phone vibrating]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]\NThe bastard lucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[footfall]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-[running footsteps]\N-[WOO JINCHUL] W-wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[AHN SANGMIN] None of them\Nunderstand Hunter Sung's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[engine whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll definitely\Nwalk out of this gate alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO MYUNGHWAN]\NAnd then I realized,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no money left\Nto buy gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-[PARK HEEJIN] What?\N-[Han Song-Yi chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO MYUNGHWAN] It was horrible!\NMy math was all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just\Nhow expensive it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIM CHUL]\NWhat the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How are they even alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,With winter coats, blankets,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,a tent, and... and food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]\N-[KIM CHUL] Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-[PARK HEEJIN] Captain?\N-[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My team was wiped out\N'cause we didn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the right gear or supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,While, you're out here\Nenjoying a damn cookout?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIM CHUL] Which one\Nof you is the hoarder?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was keeping\Nall of this a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my teammates killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Heejin Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[HAN SONG-YI]\NI'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIM CHUL] You knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you went with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consider everyone guilty\Nif you don't answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, somebody'd better talk\Nby the count of three!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether they confess or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it was Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-[SUNG JINWOO] Four.\N-[Kim Chul grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kim Chul screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're blaming your comrades'\Ndeaths on who, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[HAN SONG-YI] Mister!\N[GO MYUNGHWAN] Great timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] I also see\Nyou brought unwanted guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the Stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't completely mask auras\Nthat strong, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[PARK HEEJIN]\NAre those ice elves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a whole\Nplatoon of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite\Nthe surprise, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears even scum\Ncan be competent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How ironic,\Ncalling human beings "scum"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,when you elves\Nare the ruthless killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[speaking foreign language]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA] Well, more\Ncompetent than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually speak\Nour language, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sung Jinwoo gasps]\NBut why do I speak it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're having a whole\Nconversation with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThis is the system's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make this simple\Nsince you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me\Nto reintroduce my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA] He told me there was\Na strong one among your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to challenge you\Nin a battle and--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[blood splashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.33,0:07:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[Barca chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You amuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanging]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHe's not gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This keeps getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to ask, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why mingle with humans\Nand pretend to be one
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,when you're obviously not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-[Barca chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA]\NConsidering your reaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you aren't aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can hear a voice\Ninside our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always saying, "kill humans",
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but, there's no\Nsuch instruction
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,when it comes to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NA voice giving orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of like\Nthe system directives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If the voice isn't\Npitting them against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only assume\Nit's because I'm the Player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you'll agree that\Nwe've no need to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's handle this sensibly,\Nshall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us the humans\Nwho're cowering behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA] Once you do,\Nwe'll leave you be and depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?\NWhat say you to our offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I say tell me who you guys are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NAnd why you're fighting humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[static buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us the humans\Nwho're cowering behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA] Once you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll leave you be and depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NWhat was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?\NWhat say you to our offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have an agreement, or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You honestly intend to make\Nenemies of us instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We clearly outnumber you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,if you haven't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sung Jinwoo chuckles]\NSure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhat's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, are these knights\Nand bears on our side,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,or is that wishful thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're made of shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And Hunter Sung...\Nmust be their master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What an outrageous\Nwaste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick around and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanging]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:09:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[arrow thwacks]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-[roars]\N-Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of their way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think any of us will be\Nmuch help in this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[arrow thwacks]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NI see why he was so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Though my summons are immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,they can't respawn\Nwithout mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a lot,\Nbut it's bound to run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell\Nhe's stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[thumping]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA]\NAh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThis'll be a challenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,even with Igris.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My regular soldiers\Nwon't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need something more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am called Barca,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,might I have your name as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Jinwoo Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind howling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:10:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[metal clanging]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I've\Nenjoyed a fight this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hu?\N[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck was I hit by?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]\NYou're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NMy mages bought me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble if that's\Nthe best your soldiers can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA]\NEven the humans want you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]\NFutile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA]\NYou cannot hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I could count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.54,0:12:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.33,0:12:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]\NFutile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[gagging]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kim Chul gasps]\NYou dirty... bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow you knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,this would happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NArise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NFrom now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,your name is Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are most amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But your new toy won't\Nbe as much fun in pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.77,0:13:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.15,0:13:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A lumbering giant\Nwith no agility!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wondering, but would you\Ncall this the standard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as hunter battles go,\NI mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[PARK HEEJIN] If it was,\Ndo you think I would've
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,chosen this career?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen\Na fight like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sure\Nit's not an illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[thudding]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA] This one\Nleaves me wanting more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stiffen your spine\Nand get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring your knight\Nwith you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NOn our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanging]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA]\NYa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA] All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hu! You die first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[gagging]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] He dodged\Na fatal blow after all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Persistent as ever,\Nbut I suggest you quit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,taking me lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're definitely strong,\NI admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,least your strength\Nin numbers is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[gagging]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[trembling]\NVery well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what your rabble\Namounts to without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Throwing away\Nyour weapon like a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.49,0:15:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword slashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you\Ndisrespect me this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to slaughter\Nall of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[BARCA]\NDon't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over when I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[blood splatters]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NI said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He was tough, but I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[thumping]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, Iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I just said it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me regret you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[thumping]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[footfall]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[PARK HEEJIN]\NWe're safe now, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NWe should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our gate's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckle]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really leaving\Nthis place and going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[HAN SONG-YI]\NI was holding my breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO MYUNGHWAN]\NI think we all were!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[PARK HEEJIN]\NWell, we can breathe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NBefore I go...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.69,0:17:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[AHN SANGMIN] At this point,\NI would estimate that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,a week has passed\Ninside the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,President, why don't you\Ngo on home and rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kichul and I can wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,With our guild members\Ntrapped inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay right where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-[sighs]\N-At least till morning breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[AHN SANGMIN] Look...\Nthey're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckles]\N-[BAEK YOONHO] Nice job, Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NIf anyone could pull through,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,of course it'd be you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,President Baek's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NHunter Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see\Nyou're both alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[footfall]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[AHN SANGMIN]\NI totally called it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.25,0:18:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NNo one else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[PARK HEEJIN]\NMm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.55,0:18:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO] Except for Park,\Nyou're all lower ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what went on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Let's go,\NI'll drive you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[HAN SONG-YI]\NOh, um, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have questions and you're\Ngoing to answer them for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NNo thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,save them for someone\Nfrom your guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NI wasn't making a suggestion,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was giving an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're not aware,\Nbut I lead this guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and six of our members\Nare now gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As their president,\Nit falls on me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to find out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,While that might be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the reason your surviving\Ntigers even lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As their president...\Nshouldn't you show me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.47,0:18:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the proper gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NPlease, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for getting\Ncarried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[engine whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO] Hunter Park.\N[PARK HEEJIN] Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like he's looking\Nto make any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[PARK HEEJIN]\NAfter he beat the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,his mood turned sour\Nall of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[AHN SANGMIN]\NWell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who isn't crabby\Nwhen they're dog-tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't make him a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NGet to work, Ahn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You have got to recruit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want that hunter\Nin our guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[AHN SANGMIN] Looks like\NI was right about
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo Sung all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[car engine idling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NGood night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.44,0:19:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm.\N-[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[HAN SONG-YI]\NUm, Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?\NNot "Mister?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for today\Nand all the days in the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.87,0:20:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be counting\Non you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[footfall]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a few hours passed\Nhere in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't walk away completely\Nempty-handed, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.89,0:20:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I could do if my level\Nwasn't high enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NDamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt a fourth attempt\Nwould've helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of effort\Nfor almost no gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[water trickling]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[water trickling]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINAH]\NHurry up, Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.18,0:20:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO]\NTop of the morning, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NYou're seriously wearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lit!\NNow let's head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.35,0:21:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,there's someone\Nwe gotta pick up on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO]\NWho?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[car door opens]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Captain Yoo!\NYou good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NThanks for the lift... Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.87,0:21:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO]\NNot "Mister?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.24,0:21:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get\Nany sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?\NNot even a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I did\Nget you home pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO] She got home late,\Nand didn't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO]\NI get what it means,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,b-but I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a nap,\NI can wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-[YOO JINHO] H-hey, uh, Boss?\N-I actually think I might...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Han is underage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[trembling]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO]\NNothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[car engine revving]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NLet's wrap these raids up fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[HAN SONG-YI]\NYou got it, Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.53,0:22:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO]\NUh, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
